[[0,1434977,0,1,1,0,"2016-11-25T10:18:45","southartful","",[],"<p>We need to destroy these fucks</p>","How The Fuck Is Brian Singer Still Free?","","pizzagate"],[1,6923512,0,0,0,0,"2016-11-25T12:01:40","mathemagician33","",[],"<p>if you're gonna make a topic like that, could you at least post some evidence to back up that allegation? I think I remember reading that he had been implicated in the Hollywood Pedophile Ring, but not all of us are completely up to speed on that aspect of the investigation as we've been focusing on the DC-related side of things. I don't mean to criticize, but as others have recently said, let's try to keep this subverse organized. We have a lot of members now - the only way a crowdsourced investigation like this is going to work is if we can properly organize the important posts, and make sure the posts that do share important info properly cite their sources. Again, I apologize if I came across as a dick. Just trying to focus on what's best for the investigation.</p>"],[2,6959608,6923512,0,0,0,"2016-11-27T22:29:46","southartful","",[],"<p>No by all means, it was a rant but I have some pretty strong testimony to that effect.</p>\n<p>I'll post the video.</p>"]]
