[[0,1434986,0,1,0,1,"2016-11-25T10:25:00","BrandonKatrena","",[],"","Antarctic Sea Ice Has Not Shrunk In 100 Years","http://www.climatedepot.com/2016/11/24/antarctic-sea-ice-has-not-shrunk-in-100-years/","Worldnews"],[1,6923478,0,2,2,0,"2016-11-25T11:55:00","codegoat","[e]",[],"<p>It's even more radical than that. We have a record documented amount of ice this year. Not kidding. This is from 2014, but you can find 2016 on your own. Russian scientists claim the next ice age will officially start in 2018, and I trust them a lot more than the ameritard satanists.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.nasa.gov/content/goddard/antarctic-sea-ice-reaches-new-record-maximum\">https://www.nasa.gov/content/goddard/antarctic-sea-ice-reaches-new-record-maximum</a></p>"],[2,6923576,6923478,4,1,3,"2016-11-25T12:13:29","Riva","",[],"<p>I mean.... Don't push a narrative. I read the article...\r\n. </p>\n<p>&quot;Studies show that globally, the decreases in Arctic sea ice far exceed the increases in Antarctic sea ice.&quot;</p>"],[3,6923688,6923576,1,3,-2,"2016-11-25T12:29:21","codegoat","[e]",[],"<p>Give me your hard data!</p>\n<p>That article is shit and untrue.</p>\n<p>I guess they provide &quot;fake news&quot;, as your ubernigger would have said. You must be american. Give me your jew science and I shall invalidate it.</p>"],[4,6923846,6923688,3,1,2,"2016-11-25T12:53:40","eeevan","",[],"<p>No really. The arctic sea ice can't keep up with the warm temperatures much longer. This year, harsh storms wrecked the regrowth that usually happens in November. We will nearly run out of artic sea ice in the North Pole by 2030, and if it keeps up at this rate, it could be mostly gone by 2020.</p>"],[5,6925703,6923846,0,0,0,"2016-11-25T16:00:52","Riva","",[],"<p>that's terrifying. If that's true, the time to live it up is right fucking now. (and trust me, i know that that's much more true than the 100 year timeline being pushed currently)</p>"]]
[]
